/**
 * (marlow-final greybox tests) The co-op greybox helpers (`src/world/maps/ctcourseGreybox.ts`,
 * `docs/marlow-final/GREYBOX-HELPERS.md` "Tests to write"): each piece is written into a real `LevelBuilder`, its lips
 * generated by the game (`generateLedges`) plus the helper's manual ledges, then checked with the game's own functions:
 * the solo running-jump reach (`tests/helpers/soloJumpReach.ts`), the leg-up search (`findJumpTarget`), the throw
 * (`throwArc`, `throwLanding`, `throwRoom`), the beams (`laserTouch`), the hang-down (`hangDepthMax`, `hangReaches`),
 * the jammer (`stepJam`, `stepDevJam`), the camera (`inFrame`, `validateSecurity`) and the course gates (`CourseState`).
 */
